{"title": "Gloves of Cinder and Sizzle", "pageid": 6897, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle", "categories": ["Gloves", "Rare items", "Sources of Fire damage", "Fire set", "Unarmed set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-rare\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Icon.png/300px-Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/6/60/Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Gloves of Cinder and Sizzle image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Icon.png/300px-Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Gloves of Cinder and Sizzle</span></a> are a rare pair of <a href=\"/wiki/Gloves\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gloves\">Gloves</a> that add <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span> damage to the wearer's unarmed attacks and the ability to cast <a href=\"/wiki/Scorching_Ray\" title=\"Scorching Ray\">Scorching Ray</a> once per <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>It was through scrying and observing blazing elementals that the monks of Plumgully Temple mastered the art of fighting fire with fists, and vice versa.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gloves\" title=\"Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png/25px-Gloves_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png/38px-Gloves_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png/50px-Gloves_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gloves\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png/25px-Gloves_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gloves\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gloves\">Gloves</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Rare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Rare</span></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/38px-Journal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/50px-Journal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Journal Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_Items_consumable_by_Gale\" title=\"List of Items consumable by Gale\">Consumable</a> by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/38px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/50px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gale\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\">Gale</a></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 240 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  240  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Monk_Fire_Gloves</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Monk_Fire_Gloves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Monk_Fire_Gloves\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">663e4a1a-5f0d-4e2e-8dcf-0fb515fc2e0f</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:663e4a1a-5f0d-4e2e-8dcf-0fb515fc2e0f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:663e4a1a-5f0d-4e2e-8dcf-0fb515fc2e0f\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Monk_Fire_Gloves</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Monk_Fire_Gloves+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Monk_Fire_Gloves+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>File</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ARM_Magic_Monk_Gloves</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scorching_Ray\" title=\"Scorching Ray\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp/40px-Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp/60px-Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp/80px-Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Scorching Ray\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp/40px-Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scorching_Ray\" title=\"Scorching Ray\">Scorching Ray</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Cast as a level 3 spell (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Dragonfire_Fists\" title=\"Dragonfire Fists\">Dragonfire Fists</a></dt><dd>Your unarmed attacks deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a>.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Rosymorn_Monastery_Trail\" title=\"Rosymorn Monastery Trail\">Rosymorn Monastery Trail</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-43&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-129</span>: Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Esther\" title=\"Esther\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/Portrait_Esther.png/25px-Portrait_Esther.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f5/Portrait_Esther.png/38px-Portrait_Esther.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f5/Portrait_Esther.png/50px-Portrait_Esther.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lady Esther\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/Portrait_Esther.png/25px-Portrait_Esther.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f5/Portrait_Esther.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Esther\" title=\"Esther\">Lady Esther</a>, north-east of the <a href=\"/wiki/Rosymorn_Monastery_Trail\" title=\"Rosymorn Monastery Trail\">Trielta Crags</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ancient_Sigil_Circle\" title=\"Ancient Sigil Circle\">waypoint</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This is one of five <a href=\"/wiki/Monk\" title=\"Monk\">Monk</a>-oriented handwear items with similar properties. Each grants 1d4 bonus damage of a different type on unarmed attacks and allows casting a different upcasted spell once per long rest. The others are <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Seraphic_Pugilist_Gloves\" title=\"Seraphic Pugilist Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Seraphic_Pugilist_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Seraphic_Pugilist_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Seraphic_Pugilist_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Seraphic_Pugilist_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Seraphic_Pugilist_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Seraphic_Pugilist_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Seraphic_Pugilist_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Seraphic_Pugilist_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/79/Seraphic_Pugilist_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Seraphic_Pugilist_Gloves\" title=\"Seraphic Pugilist Gloves\">Seraphic Pugilist Gloves</a>, <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Servitor_of_the_Black_Hand_Gloves\" title=\"Servitor of the Black Hand Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Servitor_of_the_Black_Hand_Gloves\" title=\"Servitor of the Black Hand Gloves\">Servitor of the Black Hand Gloves</a>, <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Snow-Dusted_Monastery_Gloves\" title=\"Snow-Dusted Monastery Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Snow-Dusted_Monastery_Gloves\" title=\"Snow-Dusted Monastery Gloves\">Snow-Dusted Monastery Gloves</a>, and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thunderpalm_Strikers\" title=\"Thunderpalm Strikers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thunderpalm_Strikers\" title=\"Thunderpalm Strikers\">Thunderpalm Strikers</a>.</li></ul>\n\n<p><i>Regarding Dragonfire Fists:</i></p>\n<ul><li><b>Dragonfire Fists</b> does not work while in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape\" title=\"Wild Shape\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/20px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/30px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/40px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wild Shape\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/20px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape\" title=\"Wild Shape\">Wild Shape</a>.</li>\n<li>The extra <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">fire</span> damage is not applied to <a href=\"/wiki/Thrown\" title=\"Thrown\">thrown</a> weapons (e.g., <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tavern_Brawler\" title=\"Tavern Brawler\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Tavern_Brawler_Icon.webp/20px-Tavern_Brawler_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Tavern_Brawler_Icon.webp/30px-Tavern_Brawler_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Tavern_Brawler_Icon.webp/40px-Tavern_Brawler_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tavern Brawler\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Tavern_Brawler_Icon.webp/20px-Tavern_Brawler_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Tavern_Brawler_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tavern_Brawler\" title=\"Tavern Brawler\">Tavern Brawler</a>).</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 300px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 298px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gloves_of_cinder_and_sizzle_dyed.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Dyed variations\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Gloves_of_cinder_and_sizzle_dyed.png/447px-Gloves_of_cinder_and_sizzle_dyed.png.webp, /w/ima